{"id":"n24074-1-10","stage":3,"title":"교체 · 交替","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24074-1-10-1","ko":"컴퓨터가 오래돼서 부품을 몇 개 바꾸셔야 되겠네요.","zh":"电脑已经用很久了，看来需要更换几件配件呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"컴퓨터가","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터가","audio":"/audio/030aed3df715066144e8.mp3"}},{"text":"오래돼서","meaning":"久，老","explanation":"오래되다：久，老；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오래되다","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89515","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래돼서","audio":"/audio/dbbd264cba91e18956b7.mp3"}},{"text":"부품을","meaning":"零件，配件，元件","explanation":"부품：零件，配件，元件；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부품","audio":"/audio/abdef91e78abe9773d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26505","senseId":"1","lemma":"부품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부품을","audio":"/audio/02ab15cc8a9ea2db6f06.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"개","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}},{"text":"바꾸셔야","meaning":"换，更换，调换","explanation":"바꾸다：换，更换，调换；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"1","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바꾸셔야","audio":"/audio/5c4e9642d99841117aa9.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠네요.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠네요","audio":"/audio/b8ed9a57ef4d5c7241c1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7d268ef946cccd3a","term":"오래되다","zh":"久，老","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3","entryId":"89515","definition":"开始或发生后，经过的时间长。","pronunciation":["오래되다","오래뒈다"]},{"id":"abdef91e78abe977","term":"부품","zh":"零件，配件，元件","audio":"/audio/abdef91e78abe9773d2b.mp3","entryId":"26505","definition":"机器等整体设备中的某一组成部分。","pronunciation":["부품"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]},{"id":"5cc3393b01c955d1","term":"바꾸다","zh":"换，更换，调换","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3","entryId":"17198","definition":"去掉原来的东西，用其他东西替代。","pronunciation":["바꾸다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/716a5719a745afdad265.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24074-1-10-2","ko":"그럼 부품 교체 비용은 얼마나 들까요?","zh":"那更换配件的费用大概要多少呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"부품","meaning":"零件，配件，元件","explanation":"부품：零件，配件，元件","readings":[{"term":"부품","audio":"/audio/abdef91e78abe9773d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26505","senseId":"1","lemma":"부품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부품","audio":"/audio/abdef91e78abe9773d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"교체","meaning":"交替，更换，更替","explanation":"교체：交替，更换，更替","readings":[{"term":"교체","audio":"/audio/084c5a6dd787cccb0b8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24074","senseId":"1","lemma":"교체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교체","audio":"/audio/084c5a6dd787cccb0b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"비용은","meaning":"费，费用","explanation":"비용：费，费用；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"비용","audio":"/audio/24423dd67b3a782699d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83163","senseId":"1","lemma":"비용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비용은","audio":"/audio/9f4a7b1e7c753e24659a.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"들까요?","meaning":"需要，花费","explanation":"들다：需要，花费；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"6","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들까요","audio":"/audio/916c34c1aa79dc37b96a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"abdef91e78abe977","term":"부품","zh":"零件，配件，元件","audio":"/audio/a